{
  "name": "the-floating-panel-corners-stay-round-during-the-slide",
  "description": "Capture both slide legs over a white page. Run build/scripts/floating-panel-corners.swift against page-alone and each burst: it detects the moving edge and compares pixels outside the rounded corners with the uncovered page. The script rejects a burst with no intermediate frames. Repeat with sidebar-position-right.settings.json and mirrored pointer coordinates for the right dock.",
